Package: sankeyplot
Title: Ranked, Stacked Sankey Diagrams with 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Haiqing", "Deng", email = "dhaiqingsunny@gmail.com",
              role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Draws the stacked Sankey diagram from the Excel workbook
    'Stacked_column_stroke_blacks_noAF.xlsx' with 'ggplot2'. At each time
    point the categories are stacked in order of size and joined by ribbons.
    The white space between bands and between bars and ribbons can be
    switched on or off. Includes the stroke risk-factor data from the
    workbook.
Encoding: UTF-8
